cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the repository as below."
title: "PRISMA-LLM Pipeline: Five-Layer Human-in-the-Loop Systematic Review Screening"
abstract: >-
  An open-source, reproducible, human-in-the-loop pipeline for PRISMA 2020-compliant
  systematic review screening. Combines multi-database API acquisition (6 sources),
  structured LLM scoring (Llama 3.3 70B, 5 PICO-aligned criteria), validated human
  oversight (triple Cohen's κ), and automated PDF retrieval (12 sources) in one
  configuration-driven, domain-agnostic workflow.
